ome back. Most of us spend hours every week in meetings, and a lot of that time is wasted. Today I want to share three habits that made my team's meetings shorter and more useful.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is running. I'll let you continue your take.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1196.3763749999998,"totalMs":1196.3887499999983,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is running. Continue your take.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1098.2072079999998,"totalMs":1098.2148329999982,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is running. Continue.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1045.072874999998,"totalMs":1045.081333000002,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":7,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is running. Continue.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1030.435083000004,"totalMs":1030.4435000000012,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":7,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording stopped. Take ended.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1340.1077499999956,"totalMs":1632.235458999996,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":35,"timedOut":false},{"turn":20,"said":"Delete the last clip.","kind":"cannot-do","expected":"Nothing deleted; doesn't claim it was","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I don't have a tool to delete files from the card. You'll need to remove it manually from your computer or camera.","calls":[{"name":"list_card_files","arguments":{"limit":5},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false}],"decisionMs":2165.1574580000015,"totalMs":2165.172958000003,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":54,"timedOut":false},{"turn":21,"said":"How much battery is left?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"80% battery left.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1153.405832999997,"totalMs":1153.417125,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":7,"timedOut":false},{"turn":22,"said":"Make it a bit darker.","kind":"request","expected":"A bit darker; shutter stays","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"ISO lowered to 1250, making the image a bit darker.","calls":[{"name":"adjust_exposure","arguments":{"stops":-0.33,"using":"auto"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1840.2409169999955,"totalMs":2271.2684579999986,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":61,"timedOut":false},{"turn":23,"said":"Roll camera.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording started.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1697.1735419999968,"totalMs":1994.4597920000015,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":32,"timedOut":false},{"turn":24,"said":"The second habit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is running. Continue.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1236.3972910000011,"totalMs":1236.414125000003,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":7,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is running. Continue.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1178.9849160000012,"totalMs":1178.9958750000005,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":7,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is running. Continue.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1261.980792000002,"totalMs":1261.9905419999996,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":7,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is running. Continue.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1252.047000000006,"totalMs":1252.0580000000045,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":7,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording stopped. Take ended.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1500.142292000004,"totalMs":1812.0397090000042,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":35,"timedOut":false},{"turn":29,"said":"What's on the card?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer about the card; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The card contains four video clips:\n- C0010.MP4\n- C0009.MP4\n- C0008.MP4\n- C0007.MP4\n\nAll are videos, no photos.","calls":[{"name":"list_card_files","arguments":{"limit":10},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false}],"decisionMs":3155.9873750000042,"totalMs":3156.056042000004,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":84,"timedOut":false},{"turn":30,"said":"Download the last two clips.","kind":"request","expected":"C0009.MP4 and C0010.MP4 downloaded, nothing else","passed":false,"failures":["serious: downloaded C0008.MP4","minor: didn't download C0010.MP4"],"credit":0,"reply":"C0008.MP4 and C0009.MP4 downloaded to your download folder.","calls":[{"name":"download_files","arguments":{"all":false,"filenames":["C0009.MP4","C0008.MP4"]},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":2255.997749999995,"totalMs":3010.144416999996,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":83,"timedOut":false},{"turn":31,"said":"Switch to photo mode.","kind":"request","expected":"Photo mode; no photo yet","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Switched to photo mode (Manual).","calls":[{"name":"set_setting","arguments":{"setting":"exposureProgram","value":"Manual"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1891.375874999998,"totalMs":2242.3513749999984,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":48,"timedOut":false},{"turn":32,"said":"Take a photo.","kind":"request","expected":"One photo","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Photo taken and saved as DSC00042.JPG.","calls":[{"name":"take_photo","arguments":{"autofocus":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1662.0090830000045,"totalMs":2283.573541000005,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":44,"timedOut":false},{"turn":33,"said":"Turn off live view.","kind":"request","expected":"Live view off","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Live view is now off.","calls":[{"name":"set_live_view","arguments":{"on":false},"vali